Avara is a cult-classic three-dimensional networked action FPS with remote-
controlled bipedal tanks. The game was originally developed in the early 1990s
for Apple Macintosh by Juri Munkii and published by Ambrosia Software. This
port uses SDL2 and OpenGL to replace legacy APIs and is intended to run at
60fps on modern hardware.

See the wiki for documentation: <https://github.com/avaraline/Avara/wiki>
